{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f28aa73afe1b2a1b5d15ebc8230dcfd46a024038882a63245cb9461ac7c35bed", "ja": "千鶴さん、お疲れ様です。この前はだいぶ\n雨に降られてしまいましたけど、体調は大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "千鹤小姐，辛苦了。之前淋了不少雨，身体还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "789854c5cdfa7cc23bf4eaa3aa566412ef7b67dc811a49154234ae73ba323f32", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様です。\nご心配、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n谢谢您的关心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "dc9086733c37b2e14c3240d24cb159edefdb26c715035383a4dfeb4065cdbf95", "ja": "けど、ご安心くださいまし。\n体調管理も、アイドルの仕事ですから。", "zh": "不过，请放心。\n管理好身体状况也是偶像的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1003_p", "source_sha256": "34d168d6ec701c4e4535fc3d7216b123b1616843baeb698537ae1f2937412cd8", "ja": "それならよかった。\nそれにしても、急に雨に降られるなんて災難でしたね。", "zh": "那就好。话说回来，突然被雨淋到，真是够倒霉的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "d378a042a0275ed11291bf5a9a8d42cf11f9132eee6507a0e7054d097b14e9b0", "ja": "ええ。急だったもので、驚きましたわ。\nあんなに、ずぶ濡れになるなんて……。", "zh": "是的，因为来得太突然，我都吓了一跳。\n没想到会被淋得那么湿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "80aac9d79a503d65b9c277061d7fd7f1a3148e392a71caf55af7679168ae5a60", "ja": "でも、雨も悪いことばかりではないと思いますわ、\n{$P$}。", "zh": "不过，我觉得下雨也不全是坏事，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "4e087e09b0f76d964014add46b2142c3bf8c45f950bb06d1617bb7dfa202f2f5", "ja": "だってステージでは、ショーに\n輝きを加えてくれましたもの！", "zh": "因为在舞台上，雨水为演出增添了光彩呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d6e19a7af29273debe33aad7e74b77430d1818700713e2628d671977f66650e2", "ja": "本番中にかかった、虹の事ですね。すごいタイミングで\n演出の一部みたいだったって、評判でしたよ。", "zh": "您是指正式演出时出现的彩虹吧。大家都说时机太巧了，简直就像演出的一部分一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "fa85c703c5c3abbee9d8ca7687f19866abf5205feaaa660b499776beba719bc9", "ja": "雨が降らなければ、虹はかからなかったんですもの。\nそう思えば、雨も悪くありませんわ♪", "zh": "要是不下雨，彩虹也不会出现。这样想想，雨也没那么讨厌了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "469b6c82aab086a22099ebf28e3483727813c97d5e136cd0b8d498861caedf99", "ja": "わたくしはアイドルとして、\n日々練習を積み重ねていますけれど……。", "zh": "我作为偶像，\n虽说每天都在不断练习……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "3ef47b09eca3b625707737e4b3a0b531bdf192462ad896d6e0940adffd8592f3", "ja": "空に虹をかけることは、さすがにできませんし。\nですから、偶然に感謝ですわ。ふふっ！", "zh": "要在天空中架起彩虹，这实在是做不到呢。所以，我要感谢这份偶然。呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1011_p", "source_sha256": "66f2f7007cf36b70e7202378f5313a1c8f01c491e1f3499920fb449fb1e0c19b", "ja": "千鶴さんは努力家なだけでなく、謙虚なんですね……。\n俺も見習わないと。", "zh": "千鹤小姐不仅努力，还很谦虚呢……。\n我也得向你学习才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "62e3aff147a68ceaa18c39f5b00dd9f9aec8ff55004702e0f76afa3c6cc0cbac", "ja": "あら。わたくし、{$P$}には、\nいつも助けられていましてよ？", "zh": "哎呀。我可是\n一直承蒙{$P$}关照呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "3a267c1386d97c9cc46b73f2cf5ea6fb34446651fa3f6b580cfea51ce1824e08", "ja": "そうですわね……わたくしが虹だとしたら、\n{$P$}は、太陽のようなものですわ！", "zh": "是呢……如果说我是彩虹，{$P$}就是太阳一样的存在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "92c7e9d610a20824deac65a0be769322ffedd5da01abedf02805598fc9fd7476", "ja": "雨が降っただけでは、虹は輝けません。\n太陽の光が当たることで、輝けるんですのよ。", "zh": "光是下雨，彩虹是不会闪耀的。只有阳光照在上面，它才能绽放光彩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1015_p", "source_sha256": "57d54410f2ea8e1581615eb34ccf0f37484cf0c4dbb09f2c38fb889474b6eda8", "ja": "千鶴さん……。", "zh": "千鹤小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "59401d2fca3f90b564bc867c681467233546dd8ab7a3667d6fde799a273a3f96", "ja": "貴方は、わたくしのプロデューサーなんですから。\n自信を持っていただかないと困りますわ！", "zh": "您可是我的制作人啊。要是不能自信一点，我会很困扰的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1cae67566b9c18d26f3fe2f193734c52f8dcebf57a6d9bce32287696d3114c94", "ja": "わかりました。なら俺は、千鶴さんの輝きを\nもっと大勢の人に届けられるよう頑張りますね！", "zh": "明白了。那么我会努力，让千鹤小姐的光芒传达给更多人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0163_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "ed1e9a97355b4ac25664fa6e6079b05f54d3b4970931436b00c0d89ce5d3731d", "ja": "その意気ですわ、{$P$}！\nこれからも期待してますわよ♪", "zh": "就是要有这股干劲，{$P$}！今后也期待你的表现哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
